{"id":"49c16a998c61a1e3","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-compactness-equivalents.md","title":"Equivalent Forms of Compactness","display":"thm-compactness-equivalents — Equivalent Forms of Compactness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-compactness-equivalents","aliases":["17-thm-compactness-equivalents"],"display":"thm-compactness-equivalents — Equivalent Forms of Compactness","depends_on":["[[17-thm-compactness]]","[[17-df-theory-properties]]","[[17-df-sentence]]","[[17-df-model]]","[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed","legacy_label":"17-thm-4.4.3"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-compactness-equivalents"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-compactness-equivalents</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-compactness-equivalents — Equivalent Forms of Compactness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"de1a11e45b1a5282\" href=\"?note=de1a11e45b1a5282\" title=\"17-thm-compactness\">17-thm-compactness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b6e4a36b436c9b93\" href=\"?note=b6e4a36b436c9b93\" title=\"17-df-ordinals-finiteness\">17-df-ordinals-finiteness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-4.4.3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-theory and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span> (model class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> (semantic consequence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Finite}\">\\(\\operatorname{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b6e4a36b436c9b93\" href=\"?note=b6e4a36b436c9b93\" title=\"17-df-ordinals-finiteness\">17-df-ordinals-finiteness</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\forall T_0\\subseteq T\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Finite}(T_0)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Mod}(T_0)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\bigr),\\\\\nT\\models\\sigma\n\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\exists T_0\\subseteq T\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Finite}(T_0)\n\\land\nT_0\\models\\sigma\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\forall T_0\\subseteq T\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Finite}(T_0)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Mod}(T_0)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\bigr),\\\\\nT\\models\\sigma\n\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\exists T_0\\subseteq T\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Finite}(T_0)\n\\land\nT_0\\models\\sigma\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The first line is satisfiability compactness; the second is finite-support compactness for semantic consequence.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-thm-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"de1a11e45b1a5282","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-thm-compactness]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-theory-properties","status":"resolved","id":"bd7acd1192e46962","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-theory-properties]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ordinals-finiteness","status":"resolved","id":"b6e4a36b436c9b93","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnc